---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const baseURL = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact Marcelo Ellwanger | Engineering & Remote Work" description="Contact Marcelo Ellwanger for software, QA, technical systems, support, operations, engineering collaboration or serious project work.">
  <section class="contact-hero wrap">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact · Professional use</p>
      <h1>Let’s talk about useful work.</h1>
      <p class="case-copy">For software engineering, QA / automation, technical systems, support or serious project conversations, LinkedIn is the current public contact route while I finalize a separate employer-facing email address.</p>
      <div class="case-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcelo-ellwanger-10657a435/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        <a class="button" href="/resume/">Choose a résumé ↗</a>
        <a class="button" href="https://github.com/marcelosofficial-ctrl" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="contact-panel mono">
      <div class="contact-email-status"><span>PUBLIC CONTACT EMAIL</span><strong>PRIVACY-SAFE ADDRESS · PENDING</strong></div>
      <div><span>AVAILABILITY</span><strong>Remote · flexible schedules</strong></div>
      <div><span>TIME ZONES</span><strong>Global</strong></div>
      <div><span>ROLE FOCUS</span><strong>Software · QA / Automation · Technical Systems</strong></div>
      <div><span>CURRENT BUILDS</span><strong>CrashScope v0.1 beta ready · EasyFLix active</strong></div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section wrap contact-paths">
    <div class="case-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Useful starting points</p><h2>Different conversations, same person.</h2></div>
    <div class="model-grid">
      <article><span class="mono model-index">01</span><h3>Hiring / recruiting</h3><p>Start with the Software / QA résumé for engineering roles, then use CrashScope, VektorDeck and Retro Game Vision as evidence of how I actually build, test and reason about systems.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resume/software/">Software / QA résumé ↗</a></article>
      <article><span class="mono model-index">02</span><h3>Technical collaboration</h3><p>VektorDeck, CrashScope and Retro Game Vision are the clearest examples of systems design, diagnostics, local-first software and evidence-first engineering.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#work">Selected work ↗</a></article>
      <article><span class="mono model-index">03</span><h3>Business / project inquiry</h3><p>Send the problem, constraints and what success would look like through LinkedIn. A dedicated public employer/contact email will be added here once the privacy-safe address is finalized.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcelo-ellwanger-10657a435/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Start on LinkedIn ↗</a></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-contact wrap">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">In person</p><h2>One URL for introductions.</h2><p>The QR code points to this live portfolio, so the same public identity can work on a résumé, event badge or future business card.</p></div>
    <figure class="portfolio-qr-card"><img src={`${baseURL}portfolio-qr.svg`} alt="QR code for Marcelo Ellwanger's portfolio" /><figcaption><span class="mono">MARCELO/LAB</span><p>Portfolio · projects · résumé · contact</p></figcaption></figure>
  </section>

  <style>
    @media (max-width:820px) {
      .contact-hero {
        gap:28px !important;
        padding-top:40px !important;
        padding-bottom:50px !important;
      }
      .contact-hero h1 {
        margin-top:12px !important;
        margin-bottom:18px !important;
      }
      .contact-hero .case-copy {
        font-size:.98rem !important;
        line-height:1.67 !important;
      }

      /* Keep LinkedIn dominant, then make the two supporting actions compact. */
      .contact-hero .case-actions {
        display:grid !important;
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)) !important;
        gap:8px !important;
        margin-top:22px !important;
      }
      .contact-hero .case-actions .button {
        min-height:46px !important;
        width:100% !important;
        padding-inline:10px !important;
        font-size:.72rem !important;
      }
      .contact-hero .case-actions .button:first-child {
        grid-column:1 / -1;
        min-height:50px !important;
        font-size:.79rem !important;
      }

      .contact-panel {
        border-radius:10px !important;
        box-shadow:0 24px 58px rgba(0,0,0,.24),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.015);
      }
      .contact-panel > div {
        min-height:56px !important;
        grid-template-columns:92px minmax(0,1fr) !important;
        gap:11px !important;
        padding:12px 14px !important;
      }
      .contact-panel span {
        font-size:.50rem !important;
        line-height:1.35;
      }
      .contact-panel strong {
        font-size:.72rem !important;
        line-height:1.4 !important;
      }
      .contact-email-status {
        position:relative;
        background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(214,255,87,.035),rgba(214,255,87,.006) 68%,transparent);
        box-shadow:inset 2px 0 0 rgba(214,255,87,.62);
      }
      .contact-email-status strong {
        color:#bac4a2 !important;
        letter-spacing:.035em;
      }
      .contact-email-status::after {
        content:"PENDING";
        position:absolute;
        right:10px;
        top:7px;
        color:#68725a;
        font-size:.39rem;
        letter-spacing:.10em;
      }

      .contact-paths {
        padding-top:58px !important;
        padding-bottom:58px !important;
      }
      .contact-paths .model-grid {
        gap:9px !important;
      }
      .contact-paths .model-grid article {
        display:flex;
        flex-direction:column;
        min-height:0 !important;
        padding:20px !important;
      }
      .contact-paths .model-grid article h3 {
        margin-top:30px !important;
        margin-bottom:10px !important;
      }
      .contact-paths .model-grid article .text-link {
        margin-top:auto !important;
        padding-top:18px !important;
      }

      .about-contact {
        gap:26px !important;
        padding-top:56px !important;
        padding-bottom:66px !important;
      }
      .about-contact h2 {
        margin-bottom:13px !important;
      }
      .portfolio-qr-card {
        width:min(185px,54vw) !important;
        justify-self:center;
      }

      /* Small stagger makes the status panel feel assembled, not dumped in. */
      .contact-panel > div {
        animation:contact-mobile-row-in .40s cubic-bezier(.22,.75,.24,1) both;
      }
      .contact-panel > div:nth-child(1) { animation-delay:.10s; }
      .contact-panel > div:nth-child(2) { animation-delay:.13s; }
      .contact-panel > div:nth-child(3) { animation-delay:.16s; }
      .contact-panel > div:nth-child(4) { animation-delay:.19s; }
      .contact-panel > div:nth-child(5) { animation-delay:.22s; }
      @keyframes contact-mobile-row-in {
        from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px); }
        to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
      }
    }

    @media (max-width:390px) {
      .contact-hero .case-actions {
        grid-template-columns:1fr !important;
      }
      .contact-hero .case-actions .button:first-child {
        grid-column:auto;
      }
      .contact-panel > div {
        grid-template-columns:1fr !important;
        gap:4px !important;
      }
      .contact-panel strong {
        text-align:left !important;
      }
      .contact-email-status::after {
        position:static;
        display:block;
        grid-column:1;
        margin-top:3px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
      .contact-panel > div {
        animation:none !important;
        transform:none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>